# AI assistant documentation and local state.
# These describe how agents should work in this repo, not how the project
# works — they are not part of the published record. AGENTS.md in particular
# is regenerated by `next dev` on every run, so tracking it just produces
# perpetual uncommitted churn.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.cursorrules
.cursor/
.aider*
.windsurfrules
.github/copilot-instructions.md
**/.claude/*
# ...but launch.json is real project config (dev-server ports and commands),
# not AI documentation, so it stays tracked.
!**/.claude/launch.json
